Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.35,0:21:33.85,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\bord5\blur5\an1\fn@方正稚艺_GBK\frz-90\pos(15,15)}在我的脑海里飞驰而过
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.31,0:21:40.35,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\bord5\blur5\an1\fn@方正稚艺_GBK\frz-90\pos(15,15)}如果那样可以的话 那样也无妨
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.02,0:21:47.02,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\bord5\blur5\an1\fn@方正稚艺_GBK\frz-90\pos(15,15)}若并非如此 那就于此刻下定决心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.68,0:21:51.77,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\bord5\blur5\an1\fn@方正稚艺_GBK\frz-90\pos(15,15)}听到的声音毫无疑问
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.77,0:21:54.06,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\bord5\blur5\an1\fn@方正稚艺_GBK\frz-90\pos(15,15)}是某一刻的我的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.85,0:21:58.35,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\bord5\blur5\an1\fn@方正稚艺_GBK\frz-90\pos(15,15)}不论是谁的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.35,0:22:01.39,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\bord5\blur5\an1\fn@方正稚艺_GBK\frz-90\pos(15,15)}也无所谓 我会将其传达
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.39,0:22:08.18,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\bord5\blur5\an1\fn@方正稚艺_GBK\frz-90\pos(15,15)}传达给赋予我的声音以意义的那个人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.39,0:22:11.64,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\bord5\blur5\an1\fn@方正稚艺_GBK\frz-90\pos(15,15)}也能够将某人的思念
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.64,0:22:15.02,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\bord5\blur5\an1\fn@方正稚艺_GBK\frz-90\pos(15,15)}一起带走 等待着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.02,0:22:20.35,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\bord5\blur5\an1\fn@方正稚艺_GBK\frz-90\pos(15,15)}跨越这声音 这思念 跨越我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.35,0:22:23.60,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\bord5\blur5\an1\fn@方正稚艺_GBK\frz-90\pos(15,15)}跨越无声的夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.60,0:22:27.06,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\bord5\blur5\an1\fn@方正稚艺_GBK\frz-90\pos(15,15)}去见你 等待着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.06,0:22:31.89,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\bord5\blur5\an1\fn@方正稚艺_GBK\frz-90\pos(15,15)}相信这声音 这思念 相信我吧
